{"chunkId": "ba75566f-83d7-5880-8741-5b46b271c090", "text": "精细加工：在阅读学习材料时，不断向自己提出\"为什么\"问题，尝试对概念之间的关系给出解释，从而加深理解与记忆。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "228ff9d0-9870-5a1d-a8a7-7d92d6c9055b", "text": "精细加工的第 1 步：阅读学习材料中的关键概念或事实。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "bbbc6fbc-323d-5c52-9979-31015c7f8057", "text": "精细加工的第 2 步：针对每个概念问\"为什么\"（例如\"为什么这个现象会发生？\"）。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "6ef32975-2765-57a0-9571-507390f24db6", "text": "精细加工的第 3 步：尝试用自己的话给出解释。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "16760416-0d9e-52da-bef7-f69ac181da63", "text": "精细加工的第 4 步：重新查看资料验证解释的准确性。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "5c908d3d-6f1d-5ef9-8890-f4f44bc1c5c2", "text": "精细加工的第 5 步：修正理解中的错误并强化正确解释。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "ba5b5581-0612-5b2b-804a-6519f5c97381", "text": "精细加工适合需要深度理解概念关系的学习，原因是：追问\"为什么\"能促使学习者建立概念之间的因果联系，形成更深层的理解。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要深度理解概念关系的学习"}}
{"chunkId": "767ca4a1-5352-56a6-bab8-ea315ba6fba6", "text": "精细加工适合已有一定领域基础知识的学习者，原因是：拥有领域知识的学习者更容易生成有意义的解释，追问策略的效果更好。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "已有一定领域基础知识的学习者"}}
{"chunkId": "6af6e574-76f1-5106-bf02-d6372a805529", "text": "精细加工不适合完全没有领域知识的新手，原因是：缺乏背景知识的学习者难以生成合理的解释，追问策略的效果会大打折扣。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "完全没有领域知识的新手"}}
{"chunkId": "50ba09ce-e3ae-5e59-b59d-6306d55b434a", "text": "精细加工不适合长文本中追问频率过低的情况，原因是：如果每隔1-2页才出现一次追问提示，效果会被严重稀释甚至逆转。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-elaborative-interrogation", "strategyName": "精细加工", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.7, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.5, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "长文本中追问频率过低的情况"}}
